{"parse": {"title": "FP-02", "pageid": 64905, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FP-01\" title=\"FP-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FP-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/FP-03\" title=\"FP-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.88.B6.E6.9D.A5.E5.93.81\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"舶来品\">舶来品</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 舶来品</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">From Abroad</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>奇<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>小<span class=\"color-value\"></span>玩<span class=\"color-value\"></span>意<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>海<span class=\"color-value\"></span>边<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191602</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306420.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-306420.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306420.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306420.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-306420.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306420.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/05/HeadIconSmall-306420.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306420.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哈哈……我同意……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如果知道未来是什么样子，那他绝不会说出这句话。<br />这是令他后悔至今的一声应和，远甚于伦敦时的无数次失足被捕。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\"><img alt=\"2_0_bg_heiandating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/600px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/900px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ee/Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png/1200px-Cg-2_0_bg_heiandating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黏糊糊的、充满了怪异气味的面具……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>让人痛苦万分的禁术……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>永无止境的奔波……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>别再做这种无谓的尝试了，没有人能够逃出重塑之手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>所有的一切，在你戴上面具的那一刻，就已经注定会发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>不过，我有一个好消息要告诉你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>别紧张，这次是货真价实的好消息——至少没那么糟糕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>下一次的行动，是在一座和平的岛上，听说那里连警察都没有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>同伴并没有如他预想的那样惊喜起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503120.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503120.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/HeadIconSmall-503120.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503120.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">重塑使徒：</div><div>……这不算好消息吗？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>哈，摧毁和平……这就是我的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>夕阳的余晖浸染了无垠的海面，浪潮遵循着固定的节律，上升，回落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他赤脚坐在海岸线上，将手伸入了金色的浪潮中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306416.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-306416.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306416.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306416.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-306416.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306416.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/HeadIconSmall-306416.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306416.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>这样，就能把落日抓在手里——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潮水退去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>它总是逃走得很快……就像孩子的童年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>连同着满盈的月亮，盛放的鲜花，转瞬即逝的喜悦与笑声……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306419.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306419.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/57/HeadIconSmall-306419.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306419.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我为什么会在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而如今，艺术与诗歌都离他远去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>我应当还在伦敦，为那些埋在顺化或者西贡的死者发声——这个世界不需要战争！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div><i>“战争意味着眼泪，从无数母亲的眼中流出……”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div><i>“生命本因其短暂而珍贵，为何我们要用来互相杀伐？”</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>沙沙的脚步声由远及近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>红发的除错师望着眼前的无理数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>你不应该在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>嘘——安静些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他看着不远处在沙中踱步的海鸥。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>它们很容易受惊飞走。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>——你的外出根本没有报备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>几位整数，为了找到消失的无理数而彻夜未眠。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一阵短暂的沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>整数？无理数？这就是你们对人的称呼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>如果我为了这些东西，而放弃这片海潮上的夕阳——那才是不可计数的损失。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海鸥扑棱着翅膀，飞向了远方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但这些都是必要的——为了摆正你们趋于过度的灵魂……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>……我不理解。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他的一再辩驳终于引起了少女轻微的恼怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……你是无理数，是无序和混乱的集合。你们必须接受真理的训导，以接近有理数的范畴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>为什么人要用数字来表达？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>为什么1是思想，2是意见，3代表智慧，4则是力量……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你们难道没有察觉到吗？你们所有的选择，都被框定在了一个小小的数字中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>没有分岔路，没有路边的风景——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>苏菲亚小姐，你不能用数学解释一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他伸手指向海平线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>你看，太阳快落下去了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>宁静的夜晚会让人思绪缱绻，黄昏只有一瞬，却带来了永恒的追忆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>随后，月亮带着潮水的节律一同上升，海鸥会回到它们的巢，将头埋在翅膀下睡眠……一切都静悄悄的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>数学里不会有这些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他眯上了眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潮水拍打着他的皮肤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306418.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306418.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-306418.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306418.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>有贝壳撞到了我的脚趾……你们的岛上，有数字可以用来形容这种感觉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508313.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508313.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/75/HeadIconSmall-508313.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508313.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……贝壳？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>那不是贝壳。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>挖掘艺术睁开双眼，看向自己的脚趾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>经过几个眨眼，他虚焦的眼睛才终于看清了眼前之物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306415.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306415.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-306415.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306415.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>——？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把漆黑的勃朗宁手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>噢，糟糕，坏文明出现了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306417.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306417.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-306417.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306417.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">挖掘艺术：</div><div>枪，枪，为什么这里会有一把枪？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FP-02"}}